atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140030/extras/81e2ba49d22517944056e0439e55e4ee.poster.avif?t=1683055765\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140030/extras/81e2ba49d22517944056e0439e55e4ee.webm?t=1683055765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>AMazing TD is made by the same team who were behind the popular tower defense named <strong>Entropy TD</strong> and <strong>Random TD</strong> from Starcraft 2. They are loosely based on <strong>Split TD</strong> from Warcraft 3.",
